---
import Button from "./Button.astro";
---

<div class="workspace-quickstart-card">
  <div class="workspace-quickstart-header">
    <strong>Bring a machine into Syntila without turning it into a team container.</strong>
  </div>
  <ol class="workspace-quickstart-steps" role="list">
    <li class="workspace-quickstart-step">
      <span class="workspace-step-num" aria-hidden="true">1</span>
      <div><strong>Open Syntila</strong><p>Sign in and open Workspaces under execution resources.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li class="workspace-quickstart-step">
      <span class="workspace-step-num" aria-hidden="true">2</span>
      <div><strong>Add a Workspace</strong><p>Create an execution environment for a machine you control.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li class="workspace-quickstart-step">
      <span class="workspace-step-num" aria-hidden="true">3</span>
      <div><strong>Pair the machine</strong><p>Connect the Workspace runtime securely and choose the Workers you want available.</p></div>
    </li>
    <li class="workspace-quickstart-step">
      <span class="workspace-step-num" aria-hidden="true">4</span>
      <div><strong>Grant it to a Space</strong><p>Spaces can use the Workspace after its owner grants access. Work runs in the Space directory under coordinated Thread leases.</p></div>
    </li>
  </ol>
  <div class="workspace-quickstart-cta">
    <Button href="https://syntila.app" label="Open Syntila →" event="cta.open_app" />
  </div>
</div>
